{"seq":1,"slug":"foundational-works","title":"Foundational Works","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/peter-drucker/major-works/foundational-works","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"concept-of-the-corporation","title":"《公司的概念》","url":"/c/people/peter-drucker/major-works/foundational-works/concept-of-the-corporation","wordCount":2058,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-practice-of-management","title":"《管理的实践》","url":"/c/people/peter-drucker/major-works/foundational-works/the-practice-of-management","wordCount":1618,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"本章考察德鲁克管理思想的奠基之作。《公司的概念》（1946年），基于对通用汽车的深入研究，第一次将\"大型企业\"作为社会组织进行系统研究（分析了分权管理、企业与社会的关系），是德鲁克管理思想的起点。《管理的实践》（1954年），被公认为第一部将\"管理\"作为独立学科系统建构的经典，标志着\"现代管理学\"的正式诞生。本章揭示这两部奠基性经典的崇高地位。\n"}